From 96fa5dbe97fe7c2f616f36f8d0bbb03a0e368189 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: keptn42 <keptn42@noreply.codeberg.org>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 11:31:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] four-rank ar_hc_write: the exact one-shot with the gated
 residual's write

At --tp 4 each gated-residual connection ran all_reduce and hc_write_bf16
as two launches. ar_hc_write_4rank fuses them: the wide exact one-shot,
reduced in place, with r4d_ar_hc_write_word as its epilogue. It takes the
steps the exact one-shot would (under 1 MiB, and under min_bytes on wht6);
larger and lossy messages keep the two launches. Two ranks unchanged.
