From e83847173d7609f2cbd4b91f817268a4a130df5b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: keptn42 <keptn42@noreply.codeberg.org>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 11:32:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] four-rank ar_gather_hc_write: the MoE gather in front of
 the exact one-shot write

At --tp 4 each MoE connection ran moe_gather and the fused write as two
launches, three or four with the inverse table. ar_gather_hc_write_4rank
runs r4d_ar_gather_word as the prologue of ar_hc_write_4rank, with the
two-rank slot table and grid rule. The arithmetic is moe_gather's plus
ar_hc_write_4rank's, so the bytes are unchanged. One and two ranks unchanged.
